description	"Pyke Syndicate Spice Dealer

Hmm...Spice...

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Overcharged Stun Baton (1)
-- Applies Flame
- Pyke Electro Weapon
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- No Blaster Block
-- 2 Swing Combo
-- Shocks/Stuns on hit
- CC-420 Blaster Pistol (Clone Pistol 2)
-- 45%+ RoF/60%- Damage/25%- Velocity, Mag Reload
- CC-500 Blaster Rifle (EE-3 3)
-- 10% More Damage/25% More FP Mult/30% Slower RoF, Mag Reload
- Unrefined Spice Grenade (Frag 2)
-- Applies Poison/Stun/75%- Damage
-- Heals Teammates (^3Use with caution, will poison/stun them)
- Smoke Grenade (Conc 1)
-- Applies Smoke Screen, Low Damage

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- 'Upper' Spice (Stimpack 1)
- 'Medicinal' Spice (Medpack 1)

^3Abilities:
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Tracking Bacta Injector (Tracking Darts 8) ^3[CS3 Melee]
-- Heals Teammates, Low Damage
- Poison Overdose Darts (Poison Darts 8) ^3[CS4 Melee]
-- Force Focus/Cripple, 100% More Damage"
